---
layout: "base.njk"
permalink: "members.html"
title: "社员大全"
seoTitle: "社员大全 | 婺需文学社"
desc: "婺需文学社社员大全：缩写与笔名对照、分部、作品索引。"
active: "members"
footerNote: "名单与笔名对照据社员 2026 年整理版；本名、分部与笔名如有变动请告知更正。页面由婺需文学社站点构建器依 taste-skill 规范生成。"
---
<main>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <p class="crumb"><a href="index.html">首页</a> / 社员大全</p>
    <h1 class="p-title rv">社员大全</h1>
    <p class="lead rv" style="margin-top:16px">名单自甲辰清明立社起陆续更新。社员以姓名拼音缩写互称，部分另有笔名；文中链接指向各自已收录作品（<a class="ink-link" href="library.html">作品库</a>），署名与归属以原稿为准。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
  {% for sec in members %}
    <div class="branch-sec rv">
      <h3>{{ sec.branch }} <small>{{ sec.members.length }} 人</small></h3>
      <div class="member-grid">
      {% for m in sec.members %}
        <div class="member" id="{{ m.id }}">
          <span class="m-name">{{ m.name }}</span>
          <span class="m-role">{{ m.role }}</span>
          <span class="m-branch">{{ m.branch }}</span>
          {% if m.note %}<p class="m-note">{{ m.note }}</p>{% endif %}
          {% for l in m.links %}
          <a class="plink" href="{{ l.href }}">{{ l.label }}</a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
  </section>
</main>
